Package: llavon-ime-fcitx5
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: llavon-ime contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/llavon-ime/ime-unix
Depends: fcitx5 (>= 5.1.12), at-spi2-core, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libc6 (>= 2.41), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libsqlite3-0, xdg-utils, curl, tar, coreutils, libqt6widgets6, libqt6network6, libqt6dbus6, qt6-qpa-plugins, qt6-wayland
Recommends: packagekit, polkitd
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Llavon IME frontend and local inference service for Fcitx5
 Llavon IME provides local llama.cpp-based text prediction for Fcitx5. This
 package includes the inference model, portable CPU backends, Vulkan backend,
 and AT-SPI integration for reading context from the focused application.
